Player Piano — ESP32-S3 self-playing acoustic piano
====================================================

Original author, designer, and creator
--------------------------------------
Steven Jin  <stevenjin20090101@gmail.com>
  - Firmware (dispatch, fire-safety, LED engine, UI, settings)
  - Web control GUI + MIDI player
  - System integration and physical installation

Hardware collaboration
-----------------------
Power-board electronics (PCA9685 solenoid drivers, opto-isolated I²C trunk)
were designed with a hardware collaborator. All firmware and software is the
work of Steven Jin.

Authorship verification
-----------------------
This project carries an Ed25519 cryptographic authorship signature.
See PROVENANCE.md to verify that Steven Jin authored these exact files.
